-zfc-relation-on.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelReflexiveRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelReflexiveRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelReflexiveRelation}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}reflexive\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelReflexiveRelation}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a> 一致的有序对记号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin